# Frontend FSD

Import direction: `app` → `routes` → `components` → `features` → `entities` → `shared`.

Canonical reference: `frontend/README.md` (mirrors sadu/admin/app layout).

## TMA-only SPA

- Layout: `routes/_tma.tsx` → `components/tma-shell/tma-layout.tsx`
- Tab routes: `/`, `/meetings`, `/checker`, `/auto`, `/profile`
- Overlay routes: `/meetings/create`, `/profile/colleague`, `/profile/admin`
- Detail-as-sheet: `/meetings/$meetingId` reuses `MeetingsListPage`
- TabBar items from `getVisibleTabBarModules(user)`; FAB unchanged by design

## Feature slices

```
features/
  auth/          — require-auth (route guard only)
  home/pages/
  meetings/{queries,search-schema,pages/,list-url,meeting-detail*}/
  # meetings/queries — URL scope filters only; reads/mutations → entities/meeting
  meeting-create/{components/,lib/,pages/}/
  checker/{components/,pages/} — useFreeSlots → entities/meeting/scheduling-queries
  auto/{fixtures.ts,pages}/
  profile/{components,pages}/
entities/
  employee/      — types, fixtures, api (searchEmployees), queries (useEmployeeSearch)
  meeting/       — api, queries, write-api, mutations, scheduling-api, scheduling-queries, lib/
  scenario/      — types
shared/
  api/           — client, types, query-client, query-keys, list-params, health, generated/schema.ts
  auth/          — types, session, tma-api, auth-context, refresh-session, module-policies, …
  lib/           — cn, list-url-params, use-list-url-state, route-revalidation, toast, format-datetime
  tma/           — i18n, stored-lang, palette, context, surface-vars, telegram-env
components/      — tma-shell/*, meetings/{detail-row,meeting-title-preview,meeting-ui/*}, employee-picker, …
app/             — providers, app-content, router, router-context
```

Feature X must not import feature Y; share via `shared/`, `entities/`, or `components/`.

## File size

Hand-written `.ts`/`.tsx` files **≤300 lines** (exception: generated `routeTree.gen.ts`, `shared/api/generated/*`). Split pages into `components/` subfolders; extract UI repeated 2+ times into `components/`.

## Data loading

- `apiFetch` + `ApiError` in `shared/api/client.ts`; Bearer via `getSession()`
- 401 single-flight: `shared/auth/refresh-session.ts`
- `queryOptions` in `entities/*/queries.ts`; mutations in `entities/meeting/mutations.ts`; keys in `shared/api/query-keys.ts`
- Home loader: `myMeetingsQuery("upcoming")`; list default: `upcoming`; detail: `all`
- Route `loader` + `shouldReload: shouldReloadExceptSearch` + `loaderDeps: () => ({})`
- List filters: `shared/lib/use-list-url-state.ts` + `TmaListPageShell`
- Health gate: `app/app-content.tsx` + `useAppHealth()`; Toaster inside gate

## Tooling

- `pnpm openapi:generate` → `shared/api/generated/schema.ts`
- Route tree: `@tanstack/router-plugin` → `src/routeTree.gen.ts` (do not hand-edit)
- `pnpm lint` — ESLint + `import/no-restricted-paths` (feature cross-imports, entities/shared boundaries)
- `pnpm test` — vitest; `*.test.tsx` uses jsdom + Testing Library
- pnpm only; UI from `@/components/ui/*` and `@/shared/ui/cat/*`
